    "description": "Title\n: Collectible Mineral Specimens Lot Amethyst Fluorite Rough Stones 3 Pieces 2 To\nColor\n: Purple, Green\nDepartment\n: Collectibles & Art\nCategory\n: Collectibles\nBrand\n: NATURAL\nType\n: Rocks\nCondition\n: Good - shows some sign of wear\nDescription\n: Discover the natural allure of raw minerals with this 3-piece set featuring striking Amethyst, vibrant Green Fluorite, and rich Lepidolite stones. Each stone boasts a distinct color and texture, inviting collectors and enthusiasts alike to appreciate their unique beauty. The Amethyst displays classic purple crystal formations, while the Green Fluorite offers translucent green hues. The Lepidolite piece is easily recognized by its lilac-tinted purple and layered appearance. These stones are ideal for mineral collectors, educational displays, or as thoughtful gifts for those exploring the world of geology. With their rough-hewn surfaces and natural shapes, they provide a tactile and visually appealing addition to any display. The included clear plastic storage box ensures easy organization and display. Overall, these stones are in visible used condition, each displaying the variations and natural imperfections typical of unpolished minerals, making every piece distinct. Stones measure approximately 2-3 inches each. Ruler and container shown for size reference only; no additional items are included\nNATURAL Rocks\nThis is a pre-owned item donated to Goodwill of Northern Michigan.\nPlease see images for further detail and ask any questions you may have before making a bid.\nItems have been tested for power, not function. In some instances we may not have the necessary equipment to test certain electronics therefore all items will be auctioned off AS-IS with no refunds.\nItems in lots are sold as-is, are not eligible for refunds, and may not be individually wrapped.\nPlease contact us before making payment to review combined shipping options.\nPick-Ups\nWe're open Monday - Friday, 8 am - 4 pm. We are closed on weekends and major holidays. For local pickup in Traverse City, please give us 24 hours from time of payment to prepare your order. Thank you!",
